e Peltola's chances around 70 to 74 percent.\n\nSullivan retains the advantages of incumbency, a large cash-on-hand edge, and heavy outside spending on his behalf, and President Trump and Vice President Vance have both campaigned in the state for him. Peltola has outraised him substantially but faces more opposition spending. The race remains close, with a modest Democratic edge.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.5747, "margin": 0.87}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.6955, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.6995, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.6965, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.6035, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.5728, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.6289, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.6364, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.6246, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.603, "margin": 1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.6381, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.6392, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.6364, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.6469, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.6459, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.6429, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.6784, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.6123, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.6534, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.6296, "margin": 2.2}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.7064, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.6746, "margin": 2.5}]}